findings.fix:
Replace the pattern at .taad/fitness.yaml:810 with:
`'(?s)<ScrollViewer\b(?!(?:(?!<!--).)*?-->)(?:"[^"]*"|''[^'']*''|[^>"''])*(?<!/)>(?:\s|<!--(?:(?!-->).)*-->|<ScrollViewer\.\w+\b[^>]*/>|<ScrollViewer\.(\w+)\b[^>]*(?<!/)>(?:(?!</ScrollViewer\.\1\s*>).)*</ScrollViewer\.\1\s*>)*<(ListView|TreeView|ListBox|DataGrid)\b'`
The lookahead after `<ScrollViewer\b` skips a tag whose next `-->` comes before any `<!--`, i.e. one inside a comment; XML comments cannot nest.
